1 _DSCR For as long as I can remember my grandmother had this plaque photo of her family on her dresser. It is of her parents: Daisy (Bryant) Black and Willie Robert Black and siblings (L-R) Mary, Carl, Ulyses, Thomas, Thelma, Roland, Robert, and Fannie. M
2 CONC issing is brother Johnnie who had already passed at the time of the photo. 
