2 CONC unday, October 18, 2020 at Lexington Medical Center.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #5e5454; font-family: 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"&gt;Bor
2 CONC n in Newberry County, he was the son of the late Asberry Glymph and the late Electra Henderson Glymph.&amp;nbsp; Mr. Glymph was the Owner of A-Team Catering, former School Board Member for Newberry County Schools and he coached baseball for the New
2 CONC berry Recreation Department from 1987-1994.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #5e5454; font-family: 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"&gt;Surviving ar
