2 CONC ry, SC; George Glymph of Columbia, SC; Walter Glymph of Pomaria, SC; four grandchildren, two great-grandchildren, on daughter-in-law, one son-in-law, three sisters-in-law, nieces, nephews, cousins and friends.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="box
2 CONC -sizing: border-box; margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #5e5454; font-family: 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"&gt;Graveside services will be conducted on Friday, October 23, 2020 at 1:00 PM at Newberry Memori
2 CONC al Gardens.&amp;nbsp; All in attendance are asked to wear a mask and to practice social distancing.&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #5e5454; font-family: 'helvetica neue', helveti
